rooms_desc ({"You just arrived on a little road, that u didn't seeuntil just now. Alone you could never have found it, noteven the best elven rangers. You are only here caussTreant Panoramix showed you the way to this magical place!To the north u hear a soft slumber of what looks like somekind of human voices. Follow Panoramix, and find out!","Here you see treants every where! On your way to here Panoramixexplained what, and what not you could do here. Don'tbother the older treants, and never make a big fire around here!All treants are relaxed causs u have a mark of Panoramixon you. You can walk around savely!","Here you here some older and wiser treants talking with eachother.Better not bother them, they dont like to be interupted!Maybe if u listen very carefully u can here something wise said.","Here in the middle between strong and brave treants you see astatue of a lady. She must really mean alot to Panoramix.An old elven gardner is keeping it clean.","You entered a place wich you didnt know was for treantswho are in love with eachother. Slowly you notice treantsflirting with eachother.Better slip away here, and leave them in their sphere of love....","As you enter this part of the little wood, you feel goodmagic radiating trough your body! You must shiver in delight and total pleasure! Panoramix tells you that thisis the place where he can change between being a strongand wise Treant, and a young, caring and tenderloving Half-Elf. Maybe one day he will show you!","Suddeny as u pass between the treants you see a more open place. Between huge caring female treants younghomeless childeren play between the treants and shelters.Arent they cute to see? Better let them play in peace.","Here floats another part of the small stream of water. More little childeren play in the water, making eachother wet.All smiling, even when they sometimes have to listen to thefemale treants, who learn then how to cooperate with naturein a good way. It will benifit them for the rest of their lives!","A little spring is here, and you see clear fresh water bubbleout of it.. making a stream to the east. The sounds of itmust make u wanne fall down and asleep!So do it, its totally safe here..","A little stream floats east and west here. Maybe youshould drink the water, and taste its purity and refreshness! Lay down and listen too the happy sound ofplaying childeren east of here, and the beautifull soundsthe birds make here!",})
rooms_short ({"Little road to the north.","Little passage between big treants!","Another beautiful place!","Here u see a statue of a very special lady, guarded by brave strong treants!","You feel that love is in the air here!","A beautiful place .. radiating good magic!","Shelters","Little healty stream..","A little spring!","Little stream of fresh water..",})
furnishings ({0,"","","","","","","","","",})
items ({0,0,({"older treants","As u listen more carefull, u hear them predict polution of the eart 8*(",}),({"statue","As u look more closely, you recognise the beautiful face of lady Exit!","gardner","An old elven man, who likes to life here, and wead!",}),({"treants","You get a little embaressed, as they notice you watching!",}),0,({"childeren","You see little childeren play happily, forgetting their troubles...","treants","Some older female treants, watching over the younger childeren.","shelters","Beautiful green, fresh and clean shelters! Oh god what a good place to grow up!",}),0,({"spring","Fresh and twinkeling water pours out of it.. the sound makes u sleepy..","stream","It floats east.. and its water makes this stream-bank so healthy green..",}),({"birds","U see some beautiful cardinals flying and singing around.. Saffrin likes them!",}),})
